PS5LM native title only (__PROSPERO__): runtime tuning knobs and per-graph timing for the
performance work (docs/PORTING.md "Performance"). ps5/native-compute/ggml-dispatch.c holds
the knobs (-1 = what device creation chose from the closed environment) and the counters.
Latched once per graph on the computing thread: fusion (with the ADD+RMS_NORM partials),
graph optimisation, nodes per submit, the flop-based submit split; read at each mat-vec
pipeline choice: the workgroup size; per graph: integer-dot mat-vec (MMVQ) off. No change on
other platforms.

--- a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
@@ -340,6 +340,16 @@
